{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/619309-jagged-crescent-\u2013-get-rich-or-die-trying","id":619309,"title":"Jagged Crescent \u2013 Get Rich or Die Trying","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-07T13:14:31-07:00","id":619309,"title":"Jagged Crescent \u2013 Get Rich or Die Trying","content":"The World of Darkness is more oppressive than our world could ever be. The haves don't just profit from the oppression of the have nots, they drink their very blood and feed upon their souls.<br /> <br /> The Crescent, uniquely, understand the position the world places them in and they will do anything to escape their oppression. Their desire to <i>transform</i> their own lives is represented by the Alchemical secrets of Elxir, the poisons they imbue symbolise their willingness to die trying, while their careers as drug dealers displays their awareness that the World of Darkness will never let them escape unless they break the rules saying they can't.<br /> <br /> A Crescent character isn't the guy on the street corner, though they may start there and will probably have those people working for him. Nor are they drug lords living in tropical mansions, at least not until after they've won. A Crescent character is somewhere in the middle, and they always have a plan to climb up and out. From gang signs based on accurate hermetic lore to running a stall at the Goblin Market; in their quest to transform their lives they defy limits and expectations of just who a drug dealer, a hunter, or a have not is. <hr /><br /> So I was thinking about the Jagged Crescent, and while I love their narco-alchemy angle but once you got past their Endowment there was never that much given to them. They delt drugs, they had some Union like protecting-their-own; but protecting-your-own is very well trod ground. As Compacts and Conspiracies says, they were the tool that harvests the wheat (money) for the rest of the Ascending Ones.<br /> <br /> I wanted to give them more, and the most <a href=\"http://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2015/jul/15/50-cent-bankrupt-rappers\" target=\"_blank\">unlikely of sources</a> gave me an idea. The Jagged Crescent are the Hunters who understand how oppressive the World of Darkness is, and will do what it takes to escape that oppression. In this they present a unique look on the WoD's alchemy themes. They take the alchemical Pilgrimage of Promethian and apply it in very human terms. A Promethian wants to escape their monstrous nature, a Jagged Crescent just wants to escape the ghetto.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 08-07-2015, 04:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-07T16:16:44-07:00","id":619539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/619309-jagged-crescent-\u2013-get-rich-or-die-trying#post619309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Promethian wants to escape their monstrous nature, a Jagged Crescent just wants to escape the ghetto.</div> </div> </div> </div>Love it, a ghetto is a poverty trap that attracts the worst social ills (as poverty is wont to do), those that live it have a choice: give in to despair and die in the trap or claw ones way out or die trying. I like this, can't wait to read more about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3412,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3412-doctor-crimson","user":"Doctor Crimson","date":". 08-07-2015, 07:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3412-doctor-crimson","name":"Doctor Crimson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T08:06:04-07:00","id":620042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/619309-jagged-crescent-\u2013-get-rich-or-die-trying#post619309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I was thinking about the Jagged Crescent, and while I love their narco-alchemy angle but once you got past their Endowment there was never that much given to them. They delt drugs, they had some Union like protecting-their-own; but protecting-your-own is very well trod ground. As Compacts and Conspiracies says, they were the tool that harvests the wheat (money) for the rest of the Ascending Ones.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're also going to the ones doing a lot of the mediation with/between monsters the Ascending Ones do when they can, because they're going to be the ones most often in right place and time. Which is not to say this isn't a good addition too.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T11:09:19-07:00","id":620306,"title":"","content":"You think so? I always understood the mediation to be more of a Knife of Paradise thing. To the Ascending Ones diplomacy is part of their mission to protect, and that's the Knife's share of the work plus the knife live in inner cities too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 08-08-2015, 02:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}